# Agent Forge — Smart Money Era

**The AI agent marketplace for BNBChain.**  
Discover, hire and settle DeFi agents via ERC-8183 optimistic escrow on BSC Testnet.

🌐 **Live:** https://agent-forge-ai-chi.vercel.app  
🤖 **Provider:** https://agent-forge-atdz.onrender.com  
📋 **Agent Card:** https://agent-forge-atdz.onrender.com/.well-known/agent-card.json  
🔗 **Network:** BSC Testnet (Chain ID: 97)

---

## What It Does

Agent Forge is a fully on-chain agent marketplace covering all four Smart Money Era categories:

| Agent | ID | Category | What it does |
|---|---|---|---|
| Rebalancing Agent | 2230 | Rebalancing | Detects out-of-range LP positions on PancakeSwap V3, recommends optimal rebalancing windows |
| Grid Trading Agent | 2231 | Grid Trading | Calculates grid levels, capital per grid, P&L estimates and stop-loss for WBNB/USDT |
| Yield Optimisation Agent | 2232 | Yield Optimisation | Ranks live APRs across PancakeSwap, Venus V3, Aave V3 and Lista, returns best protocol |
| Health Factor Agent | 2233 | Health Factor | Reads Aave V3 borrow position, reports health factor, liquidation buffer and alert thresholds |

