## Architecture

frontend/ # Vite + React + TypeScript — deployed on Vercel
├── src/
│ └── main.tsx # Marketplace UI, ERC-8183 hire flow, manifest viewer

03_provider.py # FastAPI provider — deployed on Render
agents/
├── rebalancing.py
├── grid_trading.py
├── yield_opt.py
└── health_factor.py

AGENT_ADVANTAGE_REPORT.md # TermiX bounty: agent vs manual comparison


**Flow:**
1. User connects wallet → selects agent category → requests quote
2. Provider signs ERC-8183 quote via `/a2a`
3. Client creates job on-chain, locks 1 $U in escrow
4. Provider detects funded job, runs agent analysis, submits result hash
5. After 1-hour dispute window → payment released, job `COMPLETED`

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Tech |
|---|---|
| Smart contracts | ERC-8183 (optimistic escrow), ERC-8004 (agent registry) |
| Provider SDK | BNBAgent SDK (`bnbagent`) |
| Backend | FastAPI + uvicorn (Python) |
| Frontend | Vite + React + TypeScript + ethers.js |
| Hosting | Render (backend) + Vercel (frontend) |
| Network | BSC Testnet (Chain ID: 97) |

---

## Running Locally

**Backend:**
```bash
cp .env.example .env
# fill PROVIDER_PRIVATE_KEY, U_TOKEN_ADDRESS, AGENT_HOST
pip install -r requirements.txt
python 03_provider.py
Frontend:

cd frontend
cp .env.example .env
# set VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8010
npm install
npm run dev
Environment Variables
Backend (.env):

PROVIDER_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...
WALLET_PASSWORD=changeme
NETWORK=bsc-testnet
AGENT_HOST=https://agent-forge-atdz.onrender.com
U_TOKEN_ADDRESS=0xc70B8741B8B07A6d61E54fd4B20f22Fa648E5565
CORS_ORIGINS=https://agent-forge-ai-chi.vercel.app
Frontend (frontend/.env):

VITE_API_URL=https://agent-forge-atdz.onrender.com
